sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant QA as src/qa.py
    participant Embed as Local sentence embedder
    participant Store as In-memory VectorStore
    participant Client as LLMClient

    User->>QA: Ask a question
    QA->>Embed: Encode question
    Embed-->>QA: Query vector
    QA->>Store: Search top-k by cosine similarity
    Store-->>QA: Ranked chunks with scores
    alt No chunks or best score below threshold
        QA-->>User: Fixed refusal; no generation call
    else Result meets threshold
        QA->>QA: Build prompt from retrieved chunk text
        QA->>Client: generate(prompt)
        Note over Client: ScriptedLLM in demo/tests;<br/>OpenAI and Gemini adapters are optional
        Client-->>QA: Answer text
        QA->>QA: Attach retrieved document, chunk, and section metadata
        QA-->>User: AnswerResult with answer and citations
    end
